  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 4,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "在前几节中，我们观察了斜率和截距对直线的影响。现在，我们在直线上选取任意两点 A 和 B，来精确计算斜率 m。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "m = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1}"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 3,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 1,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          },
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "number": 2,
            "end_value": 0,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "当点 A 的横坐标为 -2 时，对应纵坐标为 -2；当点 B 的横坐标为 2 时，对应纵坐标为 2。横向变化量 Δx 等于 4，纵向变化量 Δy 等于 4。两者的比值即斜率 m 等于 1。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "斜率公式要点",
              "items": [
                "Δx = x2 - x1（横向变化量）",
                "Δy = y2 - y1（纵向变化量）",
                "斜率 m = Δy / Δx 表示直线的倾斜率"
              ]
            },
            "reusable_item": 2,
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "强调两点坐标变化与斜率公式的关系",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "请试着将点 B 的横坐标 x2 调整到 3。观察纵向变化量与横向变化量的比值是否依然保持为 1。",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
